                <h1 class="h2 fw-bold mb-2">1.1 What is Software Architecture?</h1>
                <p class="mb-2 mb-lg-0">The practical blueprint that helps teams build software that is scalable, maintainable, and easier to evolve.</p>
                <a href="/Microservices" class="btn btn-sm btn-light mt-2">← Back to Microservices Course</a>
            </div>
            <div class="text-lg-end">
